## 1. Project Overview

The **AI-Based Student Performance Prediction and Learning Recommendation System** is a web-based AI/ML application designed to help students understand their academic performance and identify areas that require improvement.

The user enters academic information such as attendance, internal marks, assignment scores, study hours, previous examination marks, and other relevant details.

The trained Machine Learning model analyzes the input and predicts the student's expected performance category.

The system also identifies weak areas and provides personalized learning recommendations.

### AI/ML Component

The project uses a **Machine Learning classification model**, such as:

**Random Forest Classifier**

The model is trained using student academic data and predicts:

* 🟢 High Performance
* 🟡 Average Performance
* 🔴 Needs Improvement

---

# 2. Real-World Problem

Students often do not know whether their current academic performance is sufficient until the final examination.

Teachers and academic coordinators also need a way to identify students who may require additional support.

Traditional evaluation mainly looks at marks after examinations. This makes it difficult to identify problems early.

This project addresses the problem by using historical academic data and Machine Learning to provide an early performance prediction.

